// mergeE with side-effecting method (section 2.4.2)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix I (KScript and KSWorld), section 2.4.2 mergeE, PDF page 24 (printed page 23)
// Also printed in: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix II (Making Applications in KSWorld), section 2.4.2 mergeE, boxed snippet, PDF page 40 (printed page 39)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

updateLine <-
    when
      mergeE(
        start.transformation,
        end.transformation,
        fill,
        width)
    then
     this.updateConnector()

// Transcription notes
// - Text layer vs image: no glyph differences found in this listing.
// - Spacing: indentation and alignment come from glyph positions, checked against the page image.
// - Uncertain glyphs: none.
